{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Do you think us so petty as to pander to a stranger's greed?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T02:24:23.847000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864331398265569280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Luard quickly thinks on his feet. \"Greed has a role I must admit. But holding on to a memory as sad and gruesome as that wouldn't do good for a person. My want for the reward aside, surely without the memory of murder they would be better off.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T02:25:37.724000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864331708128034846","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Once the eyes of a god. Now the eyes of ourselves. You are asking all the wrong questions. We have seen. We bare witness to every inch of our domain. \"","created_at":"2021-07-13T02:28:07.546000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864332336527441990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
