{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(ok)","created_at":"2021-07-13T05:47:52.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864382603708989470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"What memory do you offer. Beware, if it is too little, we will grow ravenous, and take far more.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T05:48:40.014000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864382804355055616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"<@!340062533304057857>","created_at":"2021-07-13T05:51:40.818000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864383562701340672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I offer everything I was before I came here to this city, all my memories except those of my power and magic are yours, in exchange for enlightenment I will offer all that I can.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T05:53:22.127000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T14:59:51.159000Z","id":"864383987623395349","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Three questions were answered. The price is now paid.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T05:54:30.855000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864384275889127494","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(those memories feel like mental white noise.)","created_at":"2021-07-13T05:54:51.873000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864384364044877834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Luard blinks in an effort to reorient his mind, a slight hint of regret flashes in his face as he tries to recall all that he has lost, but fails. What's done is done, he now has to move on with what he has done. \"I will now take my leave.\" He exclaims to the grove. \"I hope to see you again on different terms.\" He adds as he leaves to move towards the streets.","created_at":"2021-07-13T05:57:43.290000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864385083020541952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"A wind blows softly at Luard's back.","created_at":"2021-07-13T05:58:21.085000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864385241543213066","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We're here.\" Luard says softly as he stops by the entrance to the grove. He takes a deep breath to calm himself. \"In there you can ask for favors from the twin ravens in exchange for something. You can give away your memories, a life, or anything with the same value.\" His eyes grow sullen as he remembers his recent visit here. \"But be warned, you might not know how important something is until you lose it.\" He then moves to the side of the entrance and leans on the wall. \"I will not join you inside. Good luck.\" He then starts playing with a butterlfy illusion he made flutter around his head.","created_at":"2021-07-14T07:55:51.369000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864777200442933258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"....Did you lose something to the twin ravens?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T07:58:37.633000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864777897805217794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I don't remember.\" Luard responds with an empty look.","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:01:42.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864778672703406100","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Seraxa tilts her head. \"That would be the case, wouldn't it? I.... I don't know if I want to forget. Push it back to the back of my head where she belongs?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:03:24.724000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864779101952671774","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The choice is yours.\" Luard gives a sympathetic look. \"My only advice is, just be sure you get to remember who you are after.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:04:51.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864779467137351680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Seraxa takes a deep breath. \"We'll worry about that if it happens.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:06:25.777000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864779861343207444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"**You will**\", Luard gives a final statement before going silent and letting Seraxa do whatever she needs to do.","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:07:07.484000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T08:07:57.664000Z","id":"864780036276224010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"In your thoughts, you feel the wind across your face. You imagine tucking in your feet, extending your arm and diving down. Of swooping up and landing. You know the raves are watching.","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:07:13.931000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864780063316770827","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The face of the green man in the will above the gate animates.","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:07:34.716000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864780150494461982","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Speak.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:07:43.336000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864780186650542081","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Seraxa plucks the crab off her head and hands him to Luard. \"Take care of him please.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:07:52.906000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864780226789113858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Luard nods and puts Orpheus on top of his head.","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:08:09.190000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864780295088898070","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Seraxa looks up at the man above the gate. \"I want to forget.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:08:44.420000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T08:08:54.392000Z","id":"864780442855014431","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Three questions you may ask. Three answers you will get.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:09:12.301000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864780559795355649","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Seraxa chooses her words carefully. \"I have,\" she turns to her side where the hag stands, \"a dark handprint on my life, placed there by my Mama. I thought I could live with it but... I can't. Not right now. I just can't. How do I get rid of this stain, get her to leave me alone?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:12:59.079000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T12:51:11.411000Z","id":"864781510972276787","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Wish for it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:13:25.749000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864781622833971230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Once asked. Once answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:13:46.287000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864781708975669248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"But see.... her meddling *made* me. If I lose her, do I also lose myself?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:14:55.576000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864781999596109826","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Her control of you is your submission to her. Lose your submission. Gain your self.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:15:57.716000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864782260230160394","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Twice asked. Twice answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:16:12.259000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864782321227137024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Her eyes get blurry with tears, but the image of Mother Elizabeth is as clear as ever. \"What will be the price of the wish?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:18:22.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864782869520187414","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"A trade.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:18:57.877000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864783015879507968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thrice Asked Thrice Answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:19:11.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864783072742080552","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Do you agree to a trade?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:19:20.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864783112726904852","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Once, we have asked.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:19:28.913000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T08:21:40.014000Z","id":"864783146054189076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Wait, that's it? No details? What... what will I be trading here?\" She blows a raspberry. \"I already asked, you won't answer that, huh.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:21:55.420000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864783760549085214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Once asked, once unansered, twice unanswered and the trade of questions will be forfeit.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:22:47.445000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864783978758012968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Then, consider it once answered,\" she echoes sadly. \"Anything. *Yes.*\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:23:18.909000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864784110726676491","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Will you risk the wrath of the hag once the pact is broken?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:24:13.930000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864784341502001182","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Twice asked\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:24:30.297000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T08:24:39.787000Z","id":"864784410150961152","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I—\" She wants to say no. It's not a risk she wants to take. But with what's on the line. \"I'll risk it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:25:59.550000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864784784504520736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Twice answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:26:16.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864784857640599562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"If a new pact is taken, will you agree to live a life not controlled by reactions, but instead by setting your intentions?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:27:18.426000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T08:27:23.733000Z","id":"864785115334311967","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The wind blows. Mother Mary stands in your way. Between you and the grove keeper.","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:30:26.965000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864785906123538492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Her skin, rotten. The stench you had forgotten, filling your nose.","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:30:55.790000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864786027025924106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Seraxa is quiet for a while. There's a lot of questions she needs to ask, things she needs to understand first, however difficult that is for her. But they'll go nowhere now. And neither will Mama.\n\nShe turns her head to the side, but the vision stays in the corner of her eye. \"Yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:31:42.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864786221653557278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thrice asked, Thrice Answered, the trade of questions is compete.\"\n\nSeraxa's soul is washed of the hag's claws. It's tears are mended. The pain has been cast out of her, as king'sbridge has cast theirs out into the Noir. Her fears, her pain, the trauma will remain within the emotional dungeons of the Noir, never again to plague her.\n\n\"Then this is the Pact. Swear it under pain of abandonment. That you shall give to the desperate the protection and solace as we have given it to you. Keep your promises. And our promises to you shall be kept.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:39:03.640000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T08:39:49.619000Z","id":"864788073215426591","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I swear, that I shall give to the desperate the protection and solace given to me. I swear it, under the pain of abandonment.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:41:01.593000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864788567947608064","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"A white raven alights on your shoulder, proof of a new pact.","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:41:36.097000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864788712667348992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
